### 3.4. Нормализация скоростей планет

```python
PLANET_SPEED_RANGES = {
    "Sun": (0.9, 1.1),
    "Moon": (12.0, 15.0),
    "Mercury": (0.5, 2.0),
    "Venus": (0.5, 1.5),
    "Mars": (0.3, 0.8),
    "Jupiter": (0.0, 0.3),
    "Saturn": (0.0, 0.15),
    "Uranus": (0.0, 0.1),
    "Neptune": (0.0, 0.05),
    "Pluto": (0.0, 0.03)
}

def normalize_speed(planet, speed):
    min_s, max_s = PLANET_SPEED_RANGES[planet]
    if max_s == min_s:
        return 0.5
    return (speed - min_s) / (max_s - min_s)
```

